              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Imwe abakama, muhe abahuuku baanyu ebihikire n'ebishemereire emirimo yaabo, nimumanya ngu naimwe mwine Mukama waanyu omu iguru.",
          "type": "text",
